  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 30 - 12 ÷ 3 × 2 + 4 = 122\n\nBODMAS Table:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/12a2f5efc6581e18151fd4baf1091425ac1ff7ac32d664772a593a32c5a6e0da.png] \n\nLet check each option, one by one:\n\n1. ÷ and -\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols, we get:\n\n⇒ __**30 ÷ 12**__ - 3 × 2 + 4 = 122\n\n⇒ 2.5 - __**3 × 2**__ + 4 = 122\n\n⇒ __**2.5**__ - 6 __**+ 4**__ = 122\n\n⇒ __**6.5**____** - 6**__ = 122\n\n⇒ 0.5 ≠ 122\n\n2. - and ×\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols, we get:\n\n⇒ __**30 × 12**__ ÷ 3 - 2 + 4 = 122\n\n⇒ __**360**____** ÷ 3**__ - 2 + 4 = 122\n\n⇒ __**120**__ - 2 __**+ 4**__ = 122\n\n⇒ 124 - 2 = 122\n\n⇒ 122 = 122\n\n3. × and +\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols, we get:\n\n⇒ 30 - __**12 ÷ 3**__ + 2 × 4 = 122\n\n⇒ 30 - 4 + 2 × 4 = 122\n\n⇒ 30 - 4 + __**2 × 4**__ = 122\n\n⇒ __**30**__ - 4 __**+ 8**__ = 122\n\n⇒ 38 - 4 = 122\n\n⇒ 34 ≠ 122\n\n4. ÷ and +\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols, we get:\n\n⇒ 30 - 12 + 3 × __2 ____÷____ 4__ = 122\n\n⇒ 30 - 12 + __**3 × 0.5**__ = 122\n\n⇒ __**30**__ - 12 __**+ **__**__**1**.5__** = 122\n\n⇒ 31.5 - 12 = 122\n\n⇒ 19.5 ≠ 122\n\nSo, \"- and ×\" are the two signs to interchange to correct the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
